udmilla_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_ludmilla_23_19","text":"but I also don't think a bit of noise is necessarily a bad thing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_23_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_ludmilla_23_20","text":"I hope we'll see each other again next winter.","jump":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_23_25","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_23_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_ludmilla_23_21","text":"Yes. I always welcome new energy coming into Snowfield.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_23_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_ludmilla_23_22","text":"My hope is that all types of different people can come to visit,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_23_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_ludmilla_23_23","text":"and that they'll come again the next winter as well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_23_24","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:snowfall_speech_ludmilla_23_24","text":"Ludmilla fiddles with the letter, which has become somewhat worn from being handled too much.","jump":"snowfall_speech_ludmilla_23_25","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":nul